      "observed": "The netlist contains both an ATtiny45 DIP-8 (U2) and an ATtiny13V SOIC-8 (U3), with every corresponding supply, ground, reset, and GPIO pin connected to the same net. For example, both PB1 pins are on PWM, both PB0 pins are on SDA, and both PB4 pins are on TACH.",
